Keeps PurgeJob out of the Silverstripe class manifest.

PurgeJob extends a class from silverstripe/queuedjobs, which is a suggestion
and not a requirement. The config layer reflects every class in the manifest,
and reflecting a class whose parent is absent is a fatal error. Composer still
autoloads this directory under PSR-4, so PurgeDispatcher reaches the job by
name on a site that has queuedjobs.
